{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:29 2026-10-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:29 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:29 2026-10-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"體壇早報｜馬天尼斯見曼聯高層後道歉 水晶宮歐霸輸波 般尼茅夫、新特蘭分途取勝。法新社、路透社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e367b3bfa1e836caa485a3853fefc614/2026-10/index_10.jpg\"/><p>曼聯中堅利辛奴馬天尼斯在與曼聯高層會面後，正式為日前炮轟管理層的言論道歉。至於今晨的歐霸賽事，水晶宮作客以2：3不敵里昂，般尼茅夫和新特蘭則分途取勝。意甲的AC米蘭亦在歐霸破敵，作客以4：0擊敗薩爾斯堡。</p><img alt=\"馬天尼斯在與高層會面後道歉。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d88cc097829e449c79813241d3c43ea/2026-10/AFP__20260831__DPPI_40227044_023__v1__HighRes__FootballEnglishChampManchesterUnitedV.jpg\"/><img alt=\"新特蘭93分鐘絕殺杜連斯。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1fe27578f07a537cdee44fb13d450dd/2026-10/AFP__20261015__D3F44FF__v2__HighRes__FblEurC3TorreenseSunderland.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.013761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:29:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:17:53.865786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:45.509624+00:00","content_hash":"e75941f73c1f98eae13dbb318ae88d58c7e580b07ef77d1f3376560338923fb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}